  "description": "On \\(\\{0,1,2\\}\\), the relation consisting of equality and the pairs \\((0,1),(1,0),(1,2),(2,1)\\) is reflexive and symmetric. It relates 0 to 1 and 1 to 2, but not 0 to 2. The elements related to 0 and 2 form \\(\\{0,1\\}\\) and \\(\\{1,2\\}\\), respectively.",
